        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": ">  noticed one problem with this change: highlighting disappears only after second unrelated cursor move if Operator-pending jump did not actually jump. I.e. with mark as a line and cursor on a: dfm - wait for highlight - l and it still highlights - l and it stops highlighting.\r\n\r\nIn normal mode, a similar scenario also happens on latest main: With mark as a line and cursor on a: `fm` - wait for highlight - `l` and it still highlights - `l` and it stops highlighting.\r\n\r\nSame cause: State is in jumping mode, but there was no jump, and thus no `CursorMoved`\r\n\r\nI have an idea to fix this in the same manner for all modes. It's probably best to create a new PR after this one is merged.\r\n\r\n",
